window.products.push({"id":767011,"name":"MALOUF Bedding Essentials Kit - Bed in a Bag - Includes One Pillow, Comforter and Sheet Set - Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYq-CNJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bed in a BagThe bed in a bag is a bedding essentials kit perfect for those who are getting a new sized bed, moving, or starting a new phase of life. Save yourself time and money by getting the bed in a bag. The set has three main components: one gelled MicrofiberA pillow, microfiber sheets, and a down-alternative comforter.one Down-Alternative PillowsThe down-alternative gelled MicrofiberA pillows have all the benefits of down without the sharp quills, inconsistent fill, and .Super Soft SheetsThe brushed microfiber sheets are the perfect mix of luxury and practicality. The micro-yarn structure produces a soft, breathable weave that is stain and wrinkle resistant. Brushing the microfiber creates a fabric that is softer and more durable than most cotton. Microfibers are 100 times thinner than a strand of hair which prevent from collecting in the material.Cozy ComforterThe down-alternative comforter is a treat to cuddle up in. The soft polyester shell is filled with gel coated microfibers. Coating the microfibers in gel helps the fibers slip past each other for a more consistent down-like fill. Twin sheet set: 1 flat sheet (69 x 97) 1 fitted sheet (39 x 75) and 1 queen size pillowcase (20 x 30) duvet cover: twin duvet (68 x 68) pillow: one standard pillow (25 x 16).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYq-CNJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B00G4MCL4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G4MCL4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G4MCL4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767012,"name":"New Creations Fabric & Foam Inc 36\" by 36\" Square Polyester Poplin Tablecloth for a 24\" table, Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yIc5dX7ML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Our tablecloth is one of the most popular sizes of table linen. This tablecloth could also be used for many home dinning tables of the similar size. The cloth is made seamless in one piece, and the edges are serged for a clean look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yIc5dX7ML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Creations Fabric & Foam Inc","source_asin":"B018UAV1KY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018UAV1KY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018UAV1KY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767013,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness We Still Do - 40th Wedding Anniversary - Square Favor Gift Boxes - Anniversary Party Bow Boxes - Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uTuuYgQ4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bow Boxes INCLUDE: 12 We Still Do - 40th Wedding Anniversary-themed square favor gift boxes. Each box SIZE measures 3.5 inches length x 3.5 inches width x 7 inches height. Bow boxes are ideal for small gifts and treats that are under 3.5 inches tall (height for storing items in closed box). When assembled and closed, each box creates a 3D paper bow-shaped top with a square bottom. CUTE GIFT BOXES: This small, closed favor box can be filled with homemade treats (fun cupcake box), party trinkets, or thank you gifts. At the party, have each guest fill their We Still Do - 40th Wedding Anniversary bow box with snacks from a candy buffet or use as a party loot box. Guests will have fun guessing what surprise each favor gift box contains. PREMIUM PARTY SUPPLY: Bow boxes are professionally printed and double-sided on heavy-duty cardstock paper, with a photo-like shine. They are hand-folded, individually inspected, and then carefully packaged. EASY ASSEMBLY: We Still Do - 40th Wedding Anniversary bow boxes will arrive flat. Each bow box has crease lines and numbered tabs for easy folding. Finish the DIY assembly by interlocking top of box to create a three-dimensional bow. Packaging will include assembly instructions. MADE IN THE USA: We Still Do - 40th Wedding Anniversary Party bow boxes are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. We Still Do - 40th Wedding Anniversary bow boxes use a No-Mess Glitter Print: Our DIY favor boxes are designed with a printed image of glitter, eliminating glitter flake while maximizing bling effect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uTuuYgQ4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B08CRZK6PF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CRZK6PF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CRZK6PF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
