window.products.push({"id":767166,"name":"Sweet Water Decor Hello Fall Candle No. 17 | Scented Soy Wax Candle for Home | 9oz Amber Jar, 40 Hour Burn Time, Made in The USA (Hello Fall)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EsnSnnN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The air is starting to get crisp and you fire up the stove. Warm and inviting aromas of cinnamon, apples, and cloves fill the air. You pour yourself a cup of hot cider. Hello, Fall! Our natural made in USA soy wax candle is the perfect fall candle - with notes of apple, cider, nutmeg, cinnamon, and cloves, you'll want to burn this autumn candle year round! SCENT NOTES - Top: Hot Cider | Middle: Cinnamon and Cloves | Base: Apple and Nutmeg CANDLE INFO - Jar Size: 9oz (7.2oz Net Weight) 2.5 x 2.5 x 3.5\" | Burn Time: 40+ Hours | Wax: Proprietary Soy Based Wax Blend | Vegan, Non-GMO, Kosher | Wick: Cotton (Lead and Zinc Free) | Premium Fragrance Oils | Gluten Free, Phthalate Free, Non-Toxic, Cruelty Free | Made in the USA, Hand-poured in Pittsburgh, PA CANDLE CARE - Always trim your wick to 1/4\" each time before lighting the candle to avoid any soot. Burn the candle so the wax pool teaches the jar edge each time to prevent wax tunneling. Do not burn the candle for more than 4 hours at a time. Keep candles away from fans, open windows, hot surfaces, children, and pets. Never leave a burning candle unattended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EsnSnnN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Water Decor","source_asin":"B08KJPTP1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KJPTP1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KJPTP1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
