window.products.push({"id":767189,"name":"Old West The Scout American Charles Marion Russell Wall Decor Art Print Poster (16x20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818HFxQOP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Long ago Native American Indians used dogs to carry their goods for travel but later the Indians would learn to ride and handle horses better than most others. Native American Indians were often divided among those who owned horses and those who didn't. When the horse entered the Native American Indians way of life, many changes came about the tribes. The use of horses brought about great benefits to the Indians, helping them obtain food easier and quicker and giving them better fighting abilities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818HFxQOP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impact Posters Gallery","source_asin":"B008KILOBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008KILOBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008KILOBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
