window.products.push({"id":767195,"name":"Silver Obsidian Crystal Balls, 50 mm /2.0” Dia, Rare Protective Stone Balls for Decoration, Healing, Meditation, Feng Shui, Hand-Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O661JVWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rare silver sheen obsidian crystal sphere, made of 100% natural and genuine silver obsidian mined at Hidalgo area of Central Mexico.  Comes with a wooden stand base for display. Sphere diameter: about 50 mm or 2.0” Packing: Wrapped with bubble foam and packed in a cartoon box. Manufacturing: hand crafted and polished without using ANY chemical treatment or dyeing. What for? Best for: Fengshui, meditation, crystal healing, Chakra grounding and balancing, divination, fortune telling, negative energy removing and shielding, and home decoration. Good for home, office and store. Silver sheen obsidian is a very rare obsidian that is characteristically a dark black Obsidian filled with bright sparkly silver-coloured inclusions that produce a chatoyancy when viewed in strong light. The frequency of silver sheen obsidian is connected to the base and third eye Chakras. *Note: 1) Due to the nature of hand-making from 100% natural silver sheen obsidian stone, please expect variations in ball dimensions, inclusions, color, crystal transparency.  2) Natural silver sheen obsidian often has internal streaks, lines or spots, which are NOT defects. 3) Each of the natural silver obsidian ball is unique and is the ONLY one in the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O661JVWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mina Heal","source_asin":"B078MWYPSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078MWYPSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078MWYPSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
