window.products.push({"id":767262,"name":"TOUCAN 12 OZ Large Double Wall Glass Coffee Mugs Bear-shaped Set of 2 Insulated Cappuccino Cups with Handles for Americano, Espresso, Ice Tea and Latt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z5P82rRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Your Beverages At Just The Right Temperature With Toucan Double Walled Glass Coffee Mugs! If you’re tired of drinking lukewarm coffee or iced tea that’s barely cool then you’re at the right place. We designed our double layer coffee cups to keep your drinks cold and hot for longer so you can enjoy them the way they are meant to. Our glass mugs for hot beverages use a double walled design that eliminates the risk of burning hands, stays cool to touch while keeping drinks hot, and maintains the flavor of your drinks unlike plastic cups making it the perfect choice for daily use. Just The Right Balance Of Durability, Style & Functionality Unlike other glass mugs, Toucan clear coffee mugs set is made using Borosilicate Glass that’s thicker, stronger and smell resistant to provide long term use without relying on any plastics, BPA or harsh chemicals. These double glass coffee cups feature ergonomic handles that fit comfortably in your hands and come with silicone coasters. Thanks to the 12 oz volume it’s perfect for cappuccino, latte, espresso, macchiato, tea, juice, iced beverages, smoothies and more! More Features You’ll Love: - Clear glass makes your drinks look as if floating in the air - The cups are easy to clean and dishwasher safe - Makes the ideal gift for coffee lovers on Birthdays, Thanksgiving, Christmas and more! - Double insulation makes sure the exterior stays cool to touch - Perfect for serving guests or just indulging yourself - Silicone coasters keep condensate out and prevents spilling on your table Note: Please do not use with metal utensils. Pre-heat the glass before use to improve longevity. Prolong The Freshness & Maintain The Flavor OF Your Drinks The Simple Way With Toucan Colored Double Wall Glass Coffee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z5P82rRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clarke Brothers","source_asin":"B087NX1KBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087NX1KBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087NX1KBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
