window.products.push({"id":767355,"name":"APUS Relax Air: Inflatable Travel Pillow for Healthy Sleep On Air Plane - Best for Your Neck and Back","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yxeRaysbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW and SMART: Apus Relax, the innovative travel pillow from Europe, was developed for everybody to enjoy deep sleep on air planes. Introducing a revolutionary sleeping position, it brings relaxation during travels to a new height. HEALTHY and COMFORTABLE: Developed with the help of a professional neurosurgeon, Apus Relax will give your body the rest it deserves. Unlike other travel pillows, Apus Relax Air allows your cervical spine to fully relax in a straight position, reducing the tension in your neck and back muscles. For extra comfort we add a soft cover to every package. 4 IN 1: Since the pillow consists of two parts that can be inflated separately, Apus Relax brings up to 4 different sleeping positions including lumbar support pillow and a position specifically designed for couples. SMALL, QUICK and EASY: Apus is made with special air valves with a removable one way insert that makes the inflation and deflation easier and faster than ever - the pillow can be inflated in only 20 seconds and deflates in less than 10 seconds. Apus Relax is sold in a practical pouch that can be filled with other travel necessities such as head phones or ear plugs. It can be easily attached to any carry-on bag. SIMPLY THE BEST: We gave the pillow a unique shape with lots of space for your chin and arms, allowing for sufficient air flow at all times. Its hypoallergenic material is suitable even for highly sensitive skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yxeRaysbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"APUS Relax","source_asin":"B079HW9XJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079HW9XJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079HW9XJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
