window.products.push({"id":767401,"name":"Cordless Lighted Ceramic Christmas Tree Vintage Tabletop Christmas Decoration Pre-Lit Colorful Mini Light Bulbs 13'' Traditional Green AA Battery Oper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ujxyMrwXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This nostalgic lighted ceramic Christmas tree is one of those pieces that will become a tradition to display on your coffee table or mantel in the holiday season. It’s a wonderful decoration to bring back childhood memories of your grandparents' home. Ours has two modern upgrades:   1.Instead of traditional light bulbs, we use LED lights that are brighter and safer. LED lights are cold to the touch no matter how long they remain on, safety risks such as burns and fires are not a concern. In addition LED lights are 90% more energy-efficient than incandescent bulbs.  2.Cordless design enables you to put it anywhere without the hassle of tangling cords. Please do remember to turn off the light manually to avoid it eating up your batteries. If the lights go dim, please replace the batteries.   Product Size: 7\" dia. x 13\"H  Package Include:  ✯1 x Ceramic Christmas Tree △1 x Star Topper (packed, not assembled) △3 x AA alkaline batteries (packed, not assembled)  △3 x Extra plastic “bulbs” in assorted colors Remark: The Christmas tree's star needs to be slotted in place when the tree is first opened and a silicon tube is used to ensure the star remains secured firmly in place when in use. Please find the star topper in the upper slot of the Styrofoam package. We hope that our ceramic tree will give you years of enjoyment and likely become an heirloom that is passed on from generation to generation. Celebrate like you did when you were a kid!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ujxyMrwXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunlit","source_asin":"B07H3SW23P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H3SW23P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H3SW23P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
