window.products.push({"id":767428,"name":"LESNNCIER Memory Foam Pillow Standard Size Bed Pillows for Sleeping,Bamboo Pillow Cover Machine Washable,Cooling White Pillows for Back and Side Sleep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A96Od2JFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please make sure that your memory foam pillow was from Lesnncier Store. Morgan’s Outlet has never been authorized by LESNNCIER brand. Be careful!!! MEMORY FOAM PILLOW STANDARD SIZE: 25x16x5inches. Washable Cover: 35% bamboo fiber and 65% polyester, which is naturally skin-friendly, so that your face and skin will be caressed nightly with all-natural ingredients. MEMORY FOAM PAD: 100% polyurethane foam core. 5 seconds slow rebound give time to effortlessly mould to the shape of your neck and head to support neck and align spine for optimal comfort.Memory foam allows pillows to conform to one's body structure and this allows for the pillow to accommodate the natural resting position of the body. DESIGNED FOR MOST POSITIONS: The unique foam pillow is perfect for back or side sleepers. Its supportive and bouncy provides excellent support and reduces head and neck pressure. Sleeping position matters. Your head(neck, spine) should be aligned when you sleep, so when you lay your head on a pillow, it shouldn’t tilt in any direction. OUTER FABRIC&CERTIFICATION: Bamboo fibers makes this cover more breathable, keep you cool and dry thanks to its superior transpiration capabilities. This memory foam pillow treated with certificated OEKO-Tex provides you a protection. It's best to pick up for your home. OTHER POINTS&GUEENTEE: 1.Invisible Zipper make you easy to change or wash over the pillowcases. 2.The pillows do take a few hours for the foam to “plump” up in a warm and well-ventilated room. 3.30-Day money back guarantee. If you have any problem, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A96Od2JFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LESNNCIER","source_asin":"B08SVQ9FGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SVQ9FGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SVQ9FGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767429,"name":"Space Heater for Indoor Use, LifePlus 50° Oscillating Portable Electric Heater with Thermostat, Ceramic Heater with Remote Control, 12H Timer for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-3Z-UAhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Fast Heating & 3 Adjustable Modes]- The ceramic space heater uses ceramic heating technology, which can quickly heat up to 75°F in 3 seconds. There are 3 modes for you to choose- low mode (1000W), high mode (1500W) and fan mode. It not only brings you warmth, but also supply air alone. If the room is too stuffy, you can turn on the fan mode. [50° Wide Oscillation]- The oscillating tower heater with 50° oscillation can cover a large area, effectively distribute the heat or wind to the corners of the room, bringing warmth to you and your family at the same time. It allows you to get rid of the tired heart that can't enjoy the warmth. [Portable & Compact Heater]- The small space heater is only 7.68 x 7.68 x 17.32 inches. Even in a small room, there is a place for it. The built-in handle makes it convenient for you to carry it to everywhere. It is suitable for indoor use, such as bedrooms, living rooms, apartments, offices, RVs and other places that need heating. [LED Display & 12H Timer]- This room space heater comes with an LED display and remote control. When you are lying on a warm bed and do not want to get up, then the remote control comes in handy. You only need to press the button to turn it on or adjust the temperature. You can also set a timer (up to 12 hours) to prevent forgetting to turn it off. [Safe & Fire Retardant]- If the electric space heater accidentally dumps, don't worry, it has a tip-over and overheating protection function. At this time, it will automatically turn off the heating to protect the safety of you and your family. It is undoubtedly a ideal choice for you! [What You Will Get]-1x Portable and Cute Space Heater, 1x Owner's Manual and Our 100% Satisfactory Service. Each heater will have a 1-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-3Z-UAhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B0987G56MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0987G56MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0987G56MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767430,"name":"P-51 Mustang Airplane Roof Mount Weathervane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nxu2d3d-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Twin Motor Plane Weathervane is truly an impressive garden decor accent, as well as a spectacular and durable outdoor decor item.Each unique weathervane design is hand crafted using 14 gauge steel and is laser cut in one piece, minimizing welding and proving a clean look with intricate detail.A special three step finishing process has been perfected to give these wonderful wind vanes an extremely durable, beautiful, and ultra-protective scratch and fade resistant finish: 1. Zinc Plating is applied on base metal for better adhesion, durability and rust prevention. 2. Copper Vein powder coat is baked on for a beautiful hammered copper look. 3. Clear Polyester powder coat is baked on to protect against UV rays and provide a durable, scratch resistant finish that also helps prevent fading. In addition to the extra durable finish, High Quality Sealed Ball Bearings allow the decorative windcups to spin freely in even the slightest breeze. You will absolutely adore this airplane lovers weathervane yard accent!Our Steel Weathervanes look great when pole-mounted in the garden, but they are also perfectly suitable for mounting on any vertical post, attached to any horizontal surface like an outdoor deck railing, or roof-mounted on any home, garage, cottage, cabin, gazebo, cupola, barn or shed.For your convenience, this Twin Motor Plane Weathervane comes complete with your choice of garden, post, deck, or rooftop mounting hardware. All our weathervane tops are 21\"W (arrow) and between 6\" to 11\" in height, depending on the design.All EZ Vane Weathervanes are proudly made in the USA and come with a one year warranty on the finish and a lifetime warranty on all workmanship.Express your passions, hobbies and interests while connecting with the winds of Mother Nature with this high-quality, decorative, and functional Twin Motor Plane Weathervane. Assembles easily in minutes, provides years of endless enjoyment, and makes a great garden gift too! Looking for even more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nxu2d3d-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B0073UI21O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0073UI21O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0073UI21O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767431,"name":"LAVANCE Bamboo Pillowcase Standard/Queen Size Set of 2 - Peach Pink Cooling Pillowcases 2 Pack with Envelope Closure, Cool and Breathable Pillow Case,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413RAsUnP6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ 100% VISCOSE DERIVED FROM BAMBOO ]: A regenerated cellulose fiber from bamboo, bamboo rayon is soft and smooth. Lavance's bamboo twill weave is different from other bamboo plain weaves. The yarns are packed closely together, resulting in strong, thick fabric, bamboo pillowcases that are more durable and less likely to be torn. [ Silky Smooth ]: Bamboo Pillowcases are made from a luxuriously silky and soft fabric to create a lustrous and shiny appearance, with a characteristic smooth texture. Lavance pillowcases are soft and strong, great for all-season use. [ Good for Hair ]: If you're one of those people with curly, wavy, damaged, or textured hair, you know that battling frizz is real. The smoothness and moisture retaining effects of bamboo pillowcases will help your hair glide over it to reduce tension and pulling at night. Unlike cotton, which tends to absorb some moisture from skin and hair, bamboo fabrics do not absorb the moisture from your hair or skin in this way. [ Wick-Way Sweat ]: These 100% bamboo viscose pillowcases have tiny gaps in the fabric, helping to wick-way sweat. Perfect for hot sleepers Bedsure pillowcases allow air to circulate through the pillowcase all night long, even in hot weather. [ Easy Care ]: Machine wash with cold water gentle cycle, low tumble dry, do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413RAsUnP6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAVANCE","source_asin":"B09Q2MMJX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q2MMJX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q2MMJX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
