window.products.push({"id":767444,"name":"Bread Slicers For Homemade Bread |Premium Rubber Wood | 5-in-1 Multi-Purpose: Knife Holder, Chopping Board, Serving Tray, Bagel Slicer | Bonus Non-Sli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MklVI9adL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to Make a Great Slice - Take your time to learn this new way of slicing! The best way to slice is to place it on the non-slip mat and/or against a backsplash so your hand can hold the bread. Different than other compact bamboo bread slicer, our cutting tray is made of solid wood, so you won't slice with weak, uneven, and shaky guide. We offer 0.4' (~0.45' with knife) and 0.95' (~1' with knife) thickness for the perfect cut. Value-Packed in this Must-Have Multi-Purpose Kitchen Gadget - Attention bread maker, we thoughtfully design our wooden guide to be used not just on your baking days, but in your everyday life. High Quality and Food Safe - Our tool is made of high-quality rubber wood, with great craftmanship and round edges for safety. It’s also easy to store and use, easy to grip with special handles. Bonus Non-Slip Mat for Better Slicing - No more slippery danger on smooth surface! Our bread box gift guide includes a non-slip liner, which is another safety feature from us. Different than other compact bamboo bread slicer, our cutting tray is made of solid wood, so you won't slice with weak, uneven, and shaky guide. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - If you ever have a problem with the product, simply contact us through our amazon listing with your order ID and you will receive a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MklVI9adL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HI-N-SEEK","source_asin":"B095NV5YJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095NV5YJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095NV5YJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
