window.products.push({"id":767504,"name":"Bissell SpotBot Hands-Free Compact Deep Carpet Cleaner, 1200B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PZNE3G26L._AC_.jpg","description":"The Bissell SpotBot hands-free compact deep cleaner is a revolutionary spot cleaner that gives you the freedom to walk away while it does the work for you. Simply set the SpotBot on the spot or stain, hit start, and walk away--SpotBot does the work for you, allowing you to do other things. The SpotBot has a preprogrammed cycle for surface or set-in stains but also switches to manual cleaning. This machine works great for removing stains such as red wine, cola, fruit juice, and coffee and also works great on pet stains. The unique spiral brushing action cleans in a circular motion; in one cycle it completes over 400 cleaning revolutions for thorough and effective removal of tough stains. The SpotBot also comes with a trial size of the Little Green Formula and a trial size of OxyGen II.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PZNE3G26L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bissell","source_asin":"B000B7MAAK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000B7MAAK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000B7MAAK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767505,"name":"FoodSeal 100 Pint Size Precut Vacuum Sealer Bags | 6\" x 10\" | 2 Boxes of 50 |\"Easy-Grab\" Dispenser Box | Heavy Duty | Food Saver Compatible | Great fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vy+ypbYSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convenient Pint Size Bags Pint size bags are perfect for small, single portions. If you're dividing up a huge pack of chicken breasts from the warehouse club into individual servings, keeping fresh a little bit of leftover cheese, freezing filets of fresh fish, or cooking a single sirloin medallion sous-vide, the pint size is your way to go. Easy to Dispense Box The unique \"Easy-Grab\" box allows bags to be quickly dispensed one at a time. There's no need anymore to fumble around with loose, unruly, and often crumpled bags. Pull the perforated top open, and you're ready to go! A Safer Bag We take your safety seriously. FoodSeal's next generation, co-extruded bags are made using food grade resins instead of harsh chemical solvents sometimes used by others. Our production and packing lines are located entirely within fully enclosed cleanrooms. Sturdy, Tough, and Universally Compatible FoodSeal vacuum bags are manufactured with just the right balance of durability and flexibility, making your bags ready to seal the toughest items while gripping your food tightly and ensuring a strong, sturdy seal each time. Our textured diamond suction channels ensure our bags work with all vacuum sealing machines. The Box Makes the Difference Prevent your bags from being squished on arrival by buying FoodSeal brand bags. All FoodSeal bags come in a protective dispenser box, arriving at your door safe and crumple free, ready to keep your food protected. Free Permanent Marker Included Use the included permanent marker to indicate expiration dates, cooking instructions, packing dates, or anything else on all your vacuum sealed items!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vy+ypbYSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FoodSeal","source_asin":"B088FHNF8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088FHNF8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088FHNF8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
