window.products.push({"id":767514,"name":"Euhomy Electric Fireplace, 50\" Recessed and Wall Mounted Electric Fireplace, Linear Fireplace with 12 Color Flame 5 Flame Settings, Operating Buttons ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X2LwHv6nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Decorative Piece - Our designers were inspired by picture frames and designed our wall mount fireplace to be larger and more beautiful than traditional models. The modern electric fireplace is made of glass on the inside and has a black stainless steel frame on the outside. The dark frame more visibly accentuates the vibrant brightness of the flames. The air vents will be narrower and the overall flame portion will be more accentuated and aesthetically pleasing. Realistic Flames For Decorative and Heating Functions - The led fireplace features a large display with ultra-high intensity LED lights that allow flames to \"burn\" realistically and colorfully. 12 color flames and 5 flame intensity settings are available to meet your desired ambiance and can be set to your liking. The wall mounted fireplace will bring you timely and adequate warmth in the cold winter months, and will be an good plus to your home in the non-cold season. Upgraded Look And DIY Assembly - This wall-mounted fireplace with faux fire logs and glass crystal creates the authentic feel and look of a traditional fireplace with a fun DIY assembly. Both can fit safely into this 50 inch electric fireplace if you wish. When you're hosting a family gathering or party, the personalized flames are sure to add a more lively atmosphere. Two Heating Modes And Safety Assurance - The thermostat has a temperature of 62-86 ℉. Two heating settings (1500W,750W) modes can be adjusted accordingly. When the fireplace overheats or the tilting angle exceeds 45 degrees,the overheating protection mechanism will immediately cut off the power to the in wall electric fireplace. With LED technology, the vent-free fireplace requires no gas or oil, no smoke or no ash, and is energy efficient and environmentally friendly. Easy To Operate & Install - Our wall fireplace electric with remote control features both operation buttons and a remote control that allows you to set the wall electric fireplace directly from the touch panel or remotely. With a top front vent, the slim electric fireplace is designed for both wall-mounted and built-in installations. Euhomy provides you with easy-to-follow instructions to guide you through the different ways to install the mounted fireplace. Dimensions & Perfect After-sales Service - 50\" × 5.6“ × 17.7” The in-wall recessed fireplace can heat over 400 square feet. With the timer function, Euhomy can inform you of better power saving times in your home. More detailed dimensional drawings are available in images. If you have any questions or concerns, send us a message and our professional after-sales team will get back to you as soon as possible within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X2LwHv6nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0BFX1QSD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFX1QSD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFX1QSD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
