window.products.push({"id":767560,"name":"35-Count Green Mini Christmas Light Set, 7ft White Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZSQpbw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful luminaries are sure to ring in the festive ambiance instantly! These mini Christmas lights enhance your bush, fence, windows, and more in just minutes. String them up and bask in their elegant glow. Product Features:. Color: green bulbs / white wire. Number of bulbs on string: 35. Bulb size: mini. Spacing between each bulb: 2.5\". Lighted length: 7'. Total length: 8'. 12\" lead cord Additional Product Features:. UL certified and approved for indoor or outdoor use. If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit. Lights are equipped with Lamp Lock feature, which makes them replaceable, interchangeable and keeps them from falling out. Comes with replacement bulbs, flasher bulb and spare fuses. Contains 1 plug with end connector which allows you to stack multiple sets together (not to exceed 210 watts). Wire gauge: 22. 120 volts, 60 hertz, .12 amps, 14.4 watts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZSQpbw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B09Q7KJFDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q7KJFDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q7KJFDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767561,"name":"HAWCAFU Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered Fireplace Fan 4 Blades Eco Fan Wood Buring Stove Top Fan for Wood/Log Burner/Fireplace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+hA5K0PbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【Save Your Bill, More Efficiency】The wood stove fan fully utilize the heat from your wood stove and disperse it to your room. The stove top fan uses 28% less wood. It's a wonderful natural circulation element. You can enjoy warmth in your room, increasing your comfort. 🔥【Powered by Heat, Healthy and Economical】 Our heat powered fan for wood burner stove, gets power from the HEAT produced by your fireplace, wood burning stove or pellet stove. Effectively dispersing warm air around your room. 🔥【Overheating Protection】 Our eco fan comes with a bi-metallic safety device at the base. When the surface temperature rises above around 650℉ /345℃, it will gently lift the front of the thermal fan to protect the TEG. The stove top fan will automatically recover normally as the surface temperature decreases. 🔥【Silent Operation】Really impressed, our heat powered stove fan is virtually silent despite going round at an impressive speed of knots and really does blow the warm air onto the room. Results in greater comfort and reduce wood consumption from your wood stove. More stable and environmental protection. 🔥【Perfect Size, High Performance】6.3 x 4.5 x 8.5 inches, the small stove fan is specially designed for small spaces, and is widely used for wood burning stoves, gas stoves, pellet stoves and more. High performance TEG module, the warmer the base of the wood stove fan, the faster the fireplace fan rotates. It will slow down and stop while the wood stove is cooling down. Operating temperature: 185℉-650℉ /85℃-345℃ 🔥【SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】: This heat powered stove fan comes with our usual strong warranty and friendly 24/7 customer service so that you can order assured it will serve you well for years to come!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+hA5K0PbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAWCAFU","source_asin":"B0991MGRC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0991MGRC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0991MGRC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
