window.products.push({"id":767615,"name":"GOESMO Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser with Touchless Rechargeable, Waterproof Soap Dispenser for Bathroom Kitchen School, Adjustable Soap Volume, Hand ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e65UmV+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🫧【Touchless & Automatic Soap Dispenser】: GOESMO automatic foaming soap dispenser sensor adopts infrared motion sensor technology to quickly and efficiently disperse soap within 0.2 seconds.The no touch soap dispenser eliminates the need to touch the soap bottle, creating a more hygienic way that no germs passed on to wash hands or dishes 🫧【Two adjustable levels with one button】: This automatic soap dispenser touchless integrates all the functions in one button , the operation is easier and more convenient. Only need to touch the power button on this touchless foam soap dispenser alternatively to control the power level you want. 🫧【USB rechargeable & Eco-friendly】: GOESMO automatic foam hand soap dispenser rechargable by usb is made with built-in chargeable 2000mA Lithium battery, to abandon the traditional design of using dry batteries, charging the electric soap dispenser 3 hours can last for 2-3 months 🫧【Waterproof & Wide application】: Touch-free hand soap dispenser is built with high premium and durable material ABS with an IP67 waterproof rating, place the smart soap dispenser in wet environment or wash without any concern, the hands free foam soap dispenser can be widely applicable in any occassion eg: bathroom, kitchen, hospital,office etc. 🫧【Resource-Saving, Money-Saving】: Countertop soap dispenser touchless can work with all kinds of ordinary detergent, dish soap, bath gels, lotion, foam, which at least saves soap up to 50%, this means saves natural resource and money. For better perfomance of using Goesmo hands free soap dispenser, diluting liquid and water at 1:2-4 ratio is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e65UmV+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOESMO","source_asin":"B09YC9ZM3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YC9ZM3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YC9ZM3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
