window.products.push({"id":767671,"name":"40oz Thermal Coffee Carafe Insulated Coffee Thermos, Stainless Steel Insulated Vacuum Coffee Carafes For Keeping Hot, Double Walled Insulated Vacuum F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dNUNJw64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【9HR HOT & 18HR COLD】GearRoot coffee carafe uses advanced double-wall vacuum insulated technology to lock the temperature, which allows for maximum temperature retention. keeps your beverage hot up to 9 hours or cold up to 18 hours, seals the taste and aroma. 【Stainless steel & Non-slip Base】100% BPA Free and non toxic. Durable 304 food grade stainless steel interior and exterior, not easy to rust. The bottom has a non-slip design, which makes the thermal carafe very stable when placed on the table. 【Ergonomic & Easy To Use】 To pour water, simply press the button, release the button to close it again. It's safe to touch the coffee flask exterior body either it is a hot or cold beverage inside, as the temperature is locked in and the carafe body stays cool. 【Leak Proof Design】the lid with food-safe silicone ring, effectively prevent water leaking. Triangle Shape Spout ensures that the water will flow out concentrately when pouring water, and will not splash out. it looks perfect as we pay great attention to quality and detail. 【Perfect Capacity】40OZ is a perfect size - not too big, not too small, but just right, It's very suitable for family daily use, meeting or traveling, provides you 6 cups of coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dNUNJw64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GearRoot","source_asin":"B0BHSH4Z43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSH4Z43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSH4Z43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
