window.products.push({"id":767724,"name":"Tablecraft 12 oz Glass Pourer w/Center Hole [Set of 12]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MOtcSi2hL._AC_.jpg","description":"This pourer with center hole is made of fluted glass and stainless steel tops. It is a clean, easy and economically-friendly way to provide sugar to guests who prefer it in their coffee. Perfect for table service. With a center hole, this pourer is ideal for pouring sugar in a clean and effective manner. Comes with 12-ounce capacity. Includes 12 shakers per pack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MOtcSi2hL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tablecraft","source_asin":"B003TWSXMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003TWSXMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003TWSXMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767725,"name":"Christmas Decor Paper Mache Ornaments Hanging Bells Size: 1.7 inches x 1.8 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G53EGNYYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Small bells for decoration on various occasion.. The designs used in papier mache naqashi are very intricate and their application requires a great deal of skill and accuracy. The patterns are painted free hand. The naqash draws from the reeservoir of patterns and motifs in his memory. The chosen design is first outlined in a light color and the spaces outlining flower or the other forms which are to be filled with color are initially painted white. After this, flower, birds and other motifs are painted.Papier mache products for gifts and decoration, handmade by craftsmen of Kashmir in India. Order these beautiful and unique christmas crafts home decor handmade Indian gift in bulk, in time for the holiday season. The creation of a papier-mache object can be divided into two distinct categories, the Sakhtsazi (making the object) and the Naqashi (painting the surface). The form is molded using a base shape. This form is made of the pulp of paper, cloth, rice straw and copper sulphate pulp. The form is then coated with gypsum and glue, followed by thin tissue paper. On drying they are rubbed, smoothened and burnished. The form is then given the base color. The colors for painting designs on the surface are obtained by grinding and soaking various vegetable mineral dyes in pigment or stone form. The object is then sandpapered and burnished, and finally painted with several coats of a varnish made of linseed oil and pine resin. Papier-mâché, has become a sophisticated art, with even more attractive results, by using real gold and silver paint and intricate decorations. The final product is a beautiful art work that cannot be called a creation of one artist. It travels many pairs of talented hands before reaching a table or a mantel. The Mughals and the Europeans were the great admirers of this craft.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G53EGNYYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShalinIndia","source_asin":"B0009WFUCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009WFUCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009WFUCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
