window.products.push({"id":767742,"name":"Huernia zebrina Life Saver Plant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vHcBIPfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Life Saver Plant (Huernia zebrina) The amazing 5-pointed, yellow, star-shaped flowers are banded in coppery brown with a dark red lifesaver rim making it appropriately named Life Saver Plant. This low-growing succulent has 4-sided stems with soft teeth at the edges and the flowers emerge intermittently. Life Saver Plant is easy-to-grow; it loves full sun and dryness between waterings. It’s perfect for a sunny windowsill and will tolerate neglectful watering. Hardiness Zone 10 Bloom Season Intermittent Sun Requirement Full Sun Grows to 3\" Minimum Temperature Indoors 45 Plant Type Easy Grower Light: Full or partial sun, a southern, eastern or western exposure. Temperature: Maintain temperatures above 50º Humidity: Humidity is not an issue in culture. Watering: Bring potting mix to dryness between waterings then thoroughly saturate the soil until some water trickles from the bottom of the pot. Growing in a clay pot will help ensure a healthy root system. Grow drier during the winter and moister during the summer. Fertilizer: Low levels of fertilizer. Once a month with a diluted solution from spring through fall. Use a balanced fertilizer no higher than 15-15-15. Pruning: Little if any pruning needed. Old and very large plants can be divided or stem can be cut back to maintain size. Insects and Disease: Few if any problems with insects. Root rot is a problem if kept too wet, especially during the winter. Comments: Easy plants to grow. Just don’t over water and grow in good light. Perfect for windowsill culture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vHcBIPfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Logee's","source_asin":"B06XRYQPTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XRYQPTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XRYQPTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":767743,"name":"Wilton Armetale Sea Life Turtle Chip and Dip Divided Server","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y05hNutzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed and crafted by hand, Wilton Armetale Serveware products are as functional as they are beautiful, and made to last a lifetime. Formal to casual, stylish to rustic, each piece we craft is designed to capture the spirit of your life. Able to withstand temperatures up to 1000 degrees F, Wilton Armetale Serveware is ideal for your cooking needs. Perfect for the oven, stove or grill, foods will stays hotter longer. Wilton Armetale serveware pieces are also designed to help keep cold foods cold; simply place your favorite serving piece in the fridge before preparing salads, sides or appetizers. Designed and crafted by hand, these beautiful products were made to last a lifetime. Made of Armetale metal, which is an aluminum-based alloy metal, that is 100% recycled, and food-safe. This piece will not rust, break, crack, or chip under normal usage. Use & Care Thoroughly wash your new piece with soft sponge or cloth and mild soap, then rinse with warm water and towel dry. Always hand wash after each use. Do not place in automatic dishwasher; detergents, harsh chemicals and hard water may harm the metal's finish. As with any metal, it is not recommended that food be stored for a sustained period of time, especially foods containing fatty acids, salad dressing or vinegar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y05hNutzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton Armetale","source_asin":"B01IVNQPGA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IVNQPGA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IVNQPGA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
