window.products.push({"id":767940,"name":"Sandwich Maker, Waffle Maker, Sandwich Grill, 3-in-1 Removable Non-Stick Plates, Grill Cheese, Food Grade Premium Stainless Steel, Cool Touch Handle, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rr0z1WHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 in 1 sandwich maker: This Sandwich toaster offers 3 removable non-stick plates. Perfect for sandwiches, waffles, grill cheese, American style sandwich toast, barbecue steaks, etc. The machine works well to make different DIY foods according to your preferences and allows you to have a different delicious breakfast everyday. It only takes three minutes to produce food without worrying about being late. Removable non-stick plates: Non-stick coating on the surface of the plate, prevent food from sticking to the sandwich maker. No oil or butter needed, makes for healthier eating. 3-in-1 sandwich maker is very easy to clean, just wipe the plate surface with soft, damp cloth after use, and they are dishwasher safe too. Easy to use: The 3-in-1 sandwich maker adopts a more user-friendly design, you can easily remove and install 3 plates. Plug in the power source to heat the grill surfaces on both sides, your food becomes crispy brown on the outside and remains tender and juicy in the middle. LED indicator lights let you know either the plate is already ready for cooking or it is switched on. Portable waffle maker: It has cool-touch locking handle for safe operation and convenient portability, perfect for dorm rooms and all sized kitchens. If you want to go on a picnic, make barbecue in the yard, the grill plate is your good choice. Durable and Safety Design: We adopt many designs for you to get a better experience, for instances, BPA-free high temperature resistant shell and food grade stainless steel grill plates makes you and your children safe. There are multiple Cooling vent holes at the bottom of the product to allow the sandwich maker to have a longer life. And the non-slip feet make it to stable when you are concentrating on your cooking. If you have any question about our product, just feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rr0z1WHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEVER","source_asin":"B08BP8JQM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-767940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BP8JQM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BP8JQM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
